		<string text=""/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="Where the picture sits on a screen taller than it, such as a folding phone's inner screen or a tablet. Top puts all the black space below it, where the touch controls are; Bottom puts it all above. Portrait always has it near the top, under the strip of buttons."/>
		<string text="The picture's shape on a screen taller than it. 4:3 is the Xbox's; 16:9 sees more to the sides and leaves more of the screen to the touch controls."/>
		<string text=""/>
		<string text="The look of the screen around the picture when you play in portrait: plain black, Halo's blue lines and rings, or Xbox green. It is never drawn over the picture."/>
